{
  "name": "@quantovainc/qcbom",
  "version": "0.1.3",
  "description": "Post quantum cryptographic bill of materials attestations. Proves the open, asset, assessment, remediation and close records of a cryptographic inventory, with ML-DSA-65 under FIPS 204 and Quantova time proofs. Only a salted commitment leaves the party that holds the inventory.",
